# =============================================================================
# Kubernetes manifests for code-server homelab deployment
# =============================================================================
# Organized into individual files under k8s/ for clarity.
# Apply all at once:  kubectl apply -k k8s/
# Or individually:    kubectl apply -f k8s/<file>.yaml
#
# Prerequisites:
#   - A running Kubernetes cluster (k3s, kubeadm, etc.)
#   - kubectl configured to point to your cluster
#   - A StorageClass available (e.g., local-path, longhorn)
#   - (Optional) An Ingress controller for external access
# =============================================================================
